    </div>
    <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);text-align:center;margin-top:6px;letter-spacing:.06em" id="simAxisNote">last 3 weeks (logged) &middot; then projected forward</div>

    <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px">
        <div class="card-label" style="margin-bottom:0" data-i18n="sim_new_schedule">planned schedule</div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">
          <span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase" data-i18n="sim_units">units</span>
          <div class="unit-toggle" id="unitToggle">
            <button id="unitMcg" class="active" onclick="setSimUnit('mcg')">mcg</button>
            <button id="unitMg" onclick="setSimUnit('mg')">mg</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sim-sub">Build the schedule you&rsquo;re considering. Each row is one dose at one clock time &mdash; amounts can differ (e.g.&nbsp;750&nbsp;mcg in the morning, 250&nbsp;mcg at night). The chart above shows your real logged history, then projects this schedule forward from now.</div>

      <div class="preset-bar" id="presetBar">
        <button class="preset-pill" data-preset="QD"  onclick="applySchedPreset('QD',this)"  title="once daily">QD &middot; 1&times;/day</button>
        <button class="preset-pill" data-preset="BID" onclick="applySchedPreset('BID',this)" title="twice daily">BID &middot; 2&times;/day</button>
        <button class="preset-pill" data-preset="TID" onclick="applySchedPreset('TID',this)" title="three times daily">TID &middot; 3&times;/day</button>
        <button class="preset-pill" data-preset="QID" onclick="applySchedPreset('QID',this)" title="four times daily">QID &middot; 4&times;/day</button>
        <button class="preset-pill" data-preset="QOD" onclick="applySchedPreset('QOD',this)" title="every other day">QOD &middot; every other day</button>
      </div>

      <div class="interval-manual" style="margin:12px 0 14px">
        <span data-i18n="sim_repeat">repeat this pattern every</span>
        <input type="number" id="schedEveryN" min="1" max="14" step="1" value="1" inputmode="numeric"
               oninput="onEveryNChange()" onblur="normalizeEveryN()">
        <span id="schedEveryNLbl">day</span>
      </div>

      <div class="sched-head">
        <span>when</span><span>clock (24h)</span><span class="r">amount</span><span class="r occ-h">&asymp; occupancy</span><span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="sched-wrap" id="schedRows"></div>
